1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,676
Owner ke liye ek special tool hai — Financial Pitch Deck.

2
00:00:03,676 --> 00:00:08,770
Yeh aapke business ki 3-year projection banata hai, aapke actual Tally data se.

3
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:13,478
Investors ke saath meeting ho ya bank loan ke liye documentation chaahiye

4
00:00:13,478 --> 00:00:14,878
yeh deck ready hai.

5
00:00:14,878 --> 00:00:19,586
16 pages, revenue growth chart, gross margin trend, cash flow projection.

6
00:00:19,586 --> 00:00:24,359
Ek teaser version bhi hai — 10 pages — WhatsApp par forward karne ke liye.

7
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:29,196
Aur Excel projections file bhi, jismein har month ki numbers editable hain.

8
00:00:29,196 --> 00:00:31,711
Sabhi files apne aap generate hoti hain

9
00:00:31,711 --> 00:00:35,322
Owner Console mein Generate Pitch Deck button dabaayein.

10
00:00:35,322 --> 00:00:37,728
Do minute mein PDF aur Excel dono ready.
